# CI workflow: kept out of pushes from this environment because the
# GitHub OAuth token lacks the `workflow` scope (server rejects pushes
# containing .github/workflows). The file is ready at
# .github/workflows/ci.yml — push it once from a machine whose token
# has workflow scope, then remove this ignore.
.github/
